From: SamiEnazi <85966743+SamiEnazi@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] build cheats.cpp when the port tree has it (the in-game Cheats page)

cheats.cpp is title knowledge (work\cheats\, gitignored): rebuild_win copies it in when it
exists. Without it the build is unchanged.
diff --git a/CMakeLists.txt b/CMakeLists.txt
index f892fce..f09d5ad 100644
--- a/CMakeLists.txt
+++ b/CMakeLists.txt
@@ -390,3 +390,9 @@ endif()
 # Install
 # ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
 install(TARGETS ${PROJECT_NAME} RUNTIME DESTINATION bin BUNDLE DESTINATION .)
+
+# The title's cheats (cheats.cpp beside this file: title knowledge, kept out of git; the
+# in-game menu's Cheats page). Built only when the tree has it.
+if(EXISTS "${CMAKE_CURRENT_SOURCE_DIR}/cheats.cpp")
+    target_sources(${PROJECT_NAME} PRIVATE "${CMAKE_CURRENT_SOURCE_DIR}/cheats.cpp")
+endif()
